# 统一 LF。Windows 默认检出成 CRLF 会让整份文件在 diff 里翻一遍，
# 且 `cargo fmt --check` 与 tools/ 下的 python 校验器都会跟着误报。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制内容里可能含 CR/LF 字节，行尾转换会直接破坏文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.blend binary
*.zip binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
